<p>The e-Way Bill serves as evidence of the movement of goods between two GST-registered places, enabling seamless transportation and reducing the likelihood of seizures or inspection by customs authorities.</p>

<p>To further secure your consignments, it is recommended to obtain IBA-approved (Indian Bottle Association) Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty). These documents serve as proof of transportation, indicating the details of goods, consignor, consignee, and the terms of transportation. IBA-approved LR/Bilty also provide <strong>additional risk coverage</strong> against unforeseen damages during transit:</p>

