	<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Verify the details mentioned on the LR/Bilty, including the cargo description, total weight, and estimated delivery date.</span></li>
	<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>In case of any discrepancies, seek clarification from the transporter to ensure proper documentation.</span></li>
</ul>

